<%= @order.event.title.upcase %>

Thank you for your reservation.
<% unless @order.amount_owed.zero? %>

<%
  str = <<~TEXT.squish()
    Closer to the event, we will contact you on this e-mail address to finalise the booking by
    paying #{apphelp_money(@order.amount_owed, currency: @order.event.currency)}. No payment
    is needed until then.
  TEXT
%><%= word_wrap(str, line_width: 78) %>
<% end %>

* <%= I18n.t('views.orders.seats', count: @order.number_of_seats) %> to <%= @order.event.title %>
* <%= evtshelp_datetime(@order.event) %>
* <%= @order.event.location %>

If there are any problems with the reservation or you find you are unable to
attend for any reason, please get in touch:

* E-mail us by replying to this message
* Call us on <%= Hcms.config.contact_tel_human %>
